27T12:32:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120682","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120682.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120682.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"When binding a modifier key (Shift, Ctrl, Alt, Meta) in the Input Map editor, the Physical Keycode mode clears the\r\n  'keycode' field and only keeps 'physical_keycode'. At runtime, is_action_pressed() fails for these keys because\r\n  modifier key events are handled differently from regular keys on every platform (Windows WM_INPUT for key-up, macOS\r\n  flagsChanged, X11 keyboard state tracking), making physical_keycode matching unreliable.\r\n\r\n  Fix: for modifier keys, preserve the keycode field alongside physical_keycode, so action_match() uses the keycode\r\n  comparison which works consistently across all platforms.\r\n\r\n  AI Disclosure\r\n\r\n  Used Claude Code to locate the relevant code paths and draft the fix, reviewed and tested manually.","closed_by":{"login":"FANXING-0710","id":126996221,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5HO_Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126996221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710","html_url":"https://github.com/FANXING-0710","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FANXING-0710/repos","events_url":"https: